  quote: 'Also require "'$B$ to extend continuously from each open half-plane onto every compact segment of either real cut bank avoiding $'"\\\\pm\\\\nu_0"'$. This is an extra admissibility assumption on the supplied data, not a consequence of finite pointwise boundary values or a claim about every quantum field theory.'"',
  uses: ['1.1']
});
