+---
+id: ex-aqft-eft-positivity-application
+kind: example
+title: Allowed and excluded coefficients in one gapped scalar channel
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: physics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
